                <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--success); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.15);"></div>
                <div style="flex: 1;">
                  <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;">📧 6. Pós-Consulta Pronto-Atend.</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted);">IMED · E-mail + WhatsApp</div>
